ommand": "frame.create", "params": {"spread": 2, "rect": [1375.0, 67.0, 1525.0, 97.0], "content": "graphic"}}, {"command": "place.load", "params": {"path": "/run/media/jesse/Speedy/magic-studio/references/storyboard/assets/washi-tape.png"}}, {"command": "place.drop", "params": {"x": 1450.0, "y": 82.0, "frame": "$983.id"}}, {"command": "object.fit", "params": {"mode": "fitProportionally", "ids": ["$983.id"]}}, {"command": "selection.set", "params": {"ids": ["$983.id"]}}, {"command": "transform.rotate", "params": {"angle": 2, "ids": ["$983.id"]}}, {"command": "frame.create", "params": {"spread": 2, "rect": [874, 112, 1524, 134], "content": "text", "text": "SAVED EXACT PROMPT"}}, {"command": "selection.set", "params": {"ids": ["$989.id"]}}, {"command": "object.fill", "params": {"swatch": "[None]"}}, {"command": "object.stroke", "params": {"swatch": "[None]", "weight": 0}}, {"command": "object.textFrameOptions", "params": {"inset": 0, "verticalJustification": "top", "ids": ["$989.id"]}}, {"command": "type.char", "params": {"attrs": {"fontFamily": "Noto Sans", "size": 13, "fill": "Rust", "tracking": 200, "fontStyle": "Bold"}}}, {"command": "type.para", "params": {"attrs": {"align": "left"}}}, {"command": "object.label", "params": {"label": "prompt_heading", "ids": ["$989.id"]}}, {"command": "frame.create", "params": {"spread": 2, "rect": [874, 146, 1524, 640], "content": "text", "text": "Draw ONE image on a 1024 x 1536 px canvas.\nRedraw the attached character exactly (same design, colours, clothing, materials) as one full-body front view, centred horizontally, about 1300 px tall, feet on a baseline at y = 1440.\nAnimation-ready stance: standing upright, feet planted shoulder-width apart with a clear gap of background between the legs from the crotch to the floor, arms held slightly away from the body (about 20 degrees) with a clear gap between each arm and the body, hands open, head level. Every limb is fully visible and not overlapping another limb.\nFelt-plush storybook character art for 2D animation. Plain transparent background, no text, labels, frames, shadows or props. Nothing touches the canvas edge. Clean solid silhouette edge with no loose fibres or specks. Every drawing of the character keeps the same design, palette, proportions and scale."}}, {"command": "selection.set", "params": {"ids": ["$997.id"]}}, {"command": "object.fill", "params": {"swatch": "[None]"}}, {"command": "object.stroke", "params": {"swatch": "[None]", "weight": 0}}, {"command": "object.textFrameOptions", "params": {"inset": 0, "verticalJustification": "top", "ids": ["$997.id"]}}, {"command": "type.char", "params": {"attrs": {"fontFamily": "Noto Serif", "size": 14.5, "fill": "Ink", "tracking": 0, "leading": {"kind": "points", "value": 22}}}}, {"command": "type.para", "params": {"attrs": {"align": "left"}}}, {"command": "object.label", "params": {"label": "exact_prompt", "ids": ["$997.id"]}}, {"command": "frame.create", "params": {"spread": 2, "rect": [874, 742, 1524, 790], "content": "text", "text": "Original drawing \u203a generated asset\nGenerated and attached \u00b7 visual review still required"}}, {"command": "selection.set", "params": {"ids": ["$1005.id"]}}, {"command": "object.fill", "params": {"swatch": "[None]"}}, {"command": "object.stroke", "params": {"swatch": "[None]", "weight": 0}}, {"command": "object.textFrameOptions", "params": {"inset": 0, "verticalJustification": "top", "ids": ["$1005.id"]}}, {"command": "type.char", "params": {"attrs": {"fontFamily": "Z003", "size": 16, "fill": "Pencil", "tracking": 0}}}, {"command": "type.para", "params": {"attrs": {"align": "left"}}}, {"command": "object.label", "params": {"label": "prompt_foot", "ids": ["$1005.id"]}}, {"command": "frame.create", "params": {"spread": 2, "rect": [850, 825, 1550, 847], "content": "text", "text": "GEOMETRY TO PRESERVE"}}, {"command": "selection.set", "params": {"ids": ["$1013.id"]}}, {"command": "object.fill", "params": {"swatch": "[None]"}}, {"command": "object.st